  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Arrhenius equation is given by,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>293</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br />and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>323</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the given values in Arrhenius equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>323</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>293</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>323</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>293</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>323</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>293</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>477</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>28811</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8118</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
